<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken cleared for Stadshypotek bid.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken cleared for Stadshypotek bid.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken AB said on Wednesday Swedish competition authorities had cleared its bid for mortgage bank Stadshypotek.  </p>
<p>Handelsbanken bid 23 billion crowns for Stadshypotek on December 12 and the bid is expected to go through as it was accepted by the government, the main owner in Stadshypotek with a 34 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
